<title>NETHERLANDS: GUCCI SHARES UP AFTER RECORD H1 NET.</title>
<headline>GUCCI SHARES UP AFTER RECORD H1 NET.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Amsterdam bourse listed Gucci rose almost seven percent at Thursday's open, after the luxury goods maker posted record first half profits.</p>
<p>The stock opened up 8.30 guilders at 132.00 after posting a first half profit of 69.9 million dollars versus 26.4 million in the same period a year ago. By 0755 GMT the stock had pared its gains to trade up 5.30 guilders at 129.00.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
